title: Demo_Dialogue
position: 308,34
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase = "">>
<<dialoguePhaseSet "NPC">> 
<<if $dialoguePhase == "start">>
<<jump Start>>
<<else>>
Dia: I don't know what to do. This is an error debug message. fix ur shit loser
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<declare $agreed_to_help = false>> 
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Dia: Hello there! Nice to see you. I hope you're enjoying this adventure!
<<if $agreed_to_help == false>>
<<declare $bunniesLost = 4>>
Dia: Have you seen any bunnies by any chance? {$bunniesLost} of mine ran out.
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Yes!
        Dia: That's great, did you catch any of them?
            ->Yes I found one!
                <<set $bunniesLost to $bunniesLost - 1>>
                Dia: Oh thank goodness! There's now {$bunniesLost} left.
                Dia: Please come back to me if you find any others. I'd really appreciate the help!
                    ->Okay I will!
                        Dia: Thank you so much!
                        <<set $agreed_to_help = true>>
                        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            ->No.
                Dia: They are quite fast! If you happen to spot one please try to catch it and bring it back!
                    ->Okay I will!
                        <<set $agreed_to_help to true>>
                        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->No.
        Dia: Oh no. Where could they have gone?
        Dia: Could you help me look? I think they ran outside when their gate broke.
            ->Yes!
                Thank you so much. 
                <<set $agreed_to_help to true>>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            ->Sorry, I'm busy.
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<else>>
<<jump agreedHelp>>
Dia: Have you seen any of my bunnies?
    ->Yes, I caught one!
        Dia: Thank goodness! Can I have it?
            ->Yes.
            <<set $bunniesLost to $bunniesLost - 1>>
                Dia: Thank you! There is {$bunniesLost} left.
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Sorry, I'm still looking.
        Dia: No worries. Please let me know if you see them. They might be outside playing in the grass.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<endif>>
===
