title: background
position: -363,143
---
Dia: I have been raising bunnies here for the past 10 years! They are my pride and joy.
Dia: I have 5 bunnies: Jack, Harry, Pumpkin, Peanut and Rascal.
    ->Which one didn't run away?
        Dia: I don't think Peanut heard the gate break, and she can't see very well.
            ->Aww
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>

